WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.397
A cubic lipid structure is almost irresistible on

00:00:03.397 --> 00:00:06.713
screen. But internal order is not a substitute for

00:00:06.713 --> 00:00:07.818
successful drug delivery.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.057
Cubosomes contain structured internal lipid domains.

00:00:19.057 --> 00:00:22.532
Their morphology is intriguing, but drug delivery is

00:00:22.532 --> 00:00:24.704
not secured by geometry alone.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.771
Theranostics links therapeutic and diagnostic

00:00:33.771 --> 00:00:37.021
ambitions. These are distinct performance claims with

00:00:37.021 --> 00:00:38.414
different measurement needs.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.347
Lipid composition, loading and surrounding biological

00:00:49.347 --> 00:00:53.209
fluids affect the practical behaviour of a nanoscale

00:00:53.209 --> 00:00:53.691
carrier.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:05.058
A ligand or proposed uptake mechanism does not alone

00:01:05.058 --> 00:01:07.464
demonstrate selective tumour delivery in vivo.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:19.474
A convincing theranostic system needs demonstrated

00:01:19.474 --> 00:01:23.505
loading, stability, biological fate and an imaging or

00:01:23.505 --> 00:01:24.513
therapeutic endpoint.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:34.102
Stability, biodistribution, safety and reproducibility

00:01:34.102 --> 00:01:38.345
determine whether a promising system can move toward

00:01:38.345 --> 00:01:39.405
clinical evaluation.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:49.212
The film distinguishes elegant nanostructure from the

00:01:49.212 --> 00:01:51.973
difficult steps required before a clinical claim.
